        0.2,
        0.8860000000000001,
        0.353
      ],
      "text": "- F.U approach\n- Merged relation approach (if both participations are total, merge 2 entity sets and relationship set into single table)",
      "page_index": 0,
      "label": "list"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        0.026,
        0.37,
        0.314,
        0.43300000000000005
      ],
      "text": "### \u2460 F.U approach",
      "page_index": 0,
      "label": "title"
    },
    {
